@startuml
title Процесс приема и проверки задачи

actor Developer as dev
actor Reviewer as rev

participant GitLab
participant Telegram
participant Reviewer

dev -> GitLab: 1 sending code
dev -> GitLab: 2 create MR
dev -> Telegram: 3 sending link to MR
Telegram -> rev: 4 link to MR
Reviewer -> GitLab: 5 sending review
GitLab -> dev: 6 checked


alt Есть замечания, нужны исправления
dev -> GitLab: 8 sending changed code
GitLab -> rev: 9 changed code
dev -> Telegram: 10 link to MR
rev -> GitLab: 11 merged
GitLab -> dev: 12 done
end
rev -> GitLab: 7 merged

@enduml